wicked-design is licensed in three parts.

1. Code, tokens and documentation (everything except fonts/, brand/ and the lockups and icons
   generated from brand/ into dist/brand/ and dist/icons/): the MIT License below.
2. The type faces in fonts/*.woff2: the SIL Open Font License 1.1, unmodified files from the
   @fontsource 5.3.0 packages (latin and latin-ext subsets). Each face's full licence text and
   copyright line is in licenses/LICENSE-<face>.txt:
     - Inter (variable): The Inter Project Authors. Same files wicked-studio self-hosts.
     - JetBrains Mono (variable): The JetBrains Mono Project Authors. Same files wicked-studio self-hosts.
     - Marcellus (static, 400): Brian J. Bonislawsky (Astigmatic), Reserved Font Name "Marcellus".
     - Dancing Script (variable): The Dancing Script Project Authors, Reserved Font Name "Dancing Script".
3. The brand lockup and icons (brand/, dist/brand/, dist/icons/): created by the project owner for
   the wicked agile brand. The source they were copied from states no licence, and none is granted
   here yet: they are not covered by part 1. Ask the project owner before using them outside the
   wicked products.

